      <title>TSA set to handle record-breaking travel during this holiday season</title>
      <link>https://justthenews.com/nation/states/center-square/tsa-prepares-record-breaking-travel-during-holiday-season?utm_source=justthenews.com&amp;utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_campaign=external-news-aggregators</link>
      <description>TSA officials said the agency is fully staffed and ready to screen a projected 44.3 million travelers at airport security checkpoints through Jan 4, 2026. The agency expects the heaviest traveler volume will be about 2.86 million on Dec. 28.</description>
